<metadata><name>White River Trail and Barlow Creek Pioneer Road Loop (from White River West Sno-Park)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:185-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.303657" lon="-121.674434"><ele>1305.0</ele><name>White River West Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:white-river-west-sno-park (OSM way/40773253); confidence: high; pdf_page: 187; book_elev_ft: 4223</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.302200" lon="-121.671200"><ele>1287.7</ele><name>Mineral Jane / White River Trail trailhead, across the highway</name><desc>source: placed on the south side of Highway 35 at the west end of the White River bridge; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 187; quote: The trail starts at the Mineral Jane trailhead across the highway from White River West Sno-Park.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.300400" lon="-121.670730"><ele>1272.7</ele><name>White River flats 1</name><desc>source: placed 60 m south-west of the south-west channel of the White River flats (OSM stream way 1321672270, then Mineral Creek way 1321672266, the channel the topo labels White River), so the whole leg is on the Mineral Jane / Ghost Forest side; confidence: low; pdf_page: 187; quote: The White River Trail follows the open flats, then scattered trees and openings.</desc></wpt>
